Package: netmapper
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Netmapper Contributors <netmapper@example.org>
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC_VERSION@)
Description: concurrent TCP port scanner for authorized network inventory
 Netmapper resolves IP addresses, CIDR networks, and DNS names, then reports
 TCP ports as open, closed, or filtered using bounded connect probes.